# VCasT All Stats 0002

Same comparison as `all_stats-0001` (1-hr HRRR T2M forecast vs. HRRR analysis, same set
of stats), but with `interpolation: true` -- the forecast is interpolated onto the target
grid before the statistics are computed, instead of being compared on its native grid.

## Command

```bash
# Computes all configured stats (with interpolation) and writes them to stat.out
vcast stat.yaml
```
